---
globs: portfoli-backend/*
alwaysApply: false
---

This rule provides standards fot the API 

- Business logic with database interactions (entity framework) should be in services which will then be injected into controllers
- Services should be implemented using have interfaces (for Dependency injection) 
- Use dependency injection for loose coupling
- use SOLID Principles
- set up propper logging
- API responses should return only the data that is in use on the front end
